{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-12",
  "title": "瞄準",
  "storyCode": "10-14",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a52d1419106a6f2c58da2addb4a460ed2536bf1c1a81b8e06e858046ca53ae7f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10-end"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街道打掃乾淨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，將軍，我們拿到的名單上的人都處理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一些想逃去其他區塊和城外的，也都照您說的那樣，把他們攔了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是有幾個漏網的......去抓他們的戰士好像又撞上了昨天那個羅德島的薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就讓那些人鑽回地下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這更方便我們一次性地把他們都解決掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多個地面上的聯絡點同時受到攻擊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的信使呢？也都被攔下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我想聽一下你的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島不清楚自救軍的地面聯絡點在哪裡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道全部地面聯絡點的，只有我們自己的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "昨天回來的路上，我們一直在被敵人追蹤。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來危機的種子在昨夜就已埋下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我並不想懷疑我們的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不可能背叛自己的兄弟姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "指揮官要為整支隊伍負責。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們不能放過任何假設。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "從工廠中被救回來的戰士，一共幾位？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟著海蒂一起回來的有十二人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這十二個人之中，有九人只是偶爾為我們提供情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外三人幫我們運送過物資，確實有可能掌握部分聯絡點位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "還有多少戰士在薩卡茲手中？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你比我更清楚，我們昨天的行動夠艱難了。雖然我很想救出他們所有人，但我不得不承認，自救軍還不夠強大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂非常努力。能救回這麼多人，已然超出我的預期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那麼，薩卡茲並不能確定哪些人會被救。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我們昨夜的行動有很大不確定性......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我想薩卡茲不可能有這樣的把握。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "除非所有人都叛變了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "這絕無可能。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "布下一枚棋子，就一定要令它生效。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "是的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "薩卡茲的指揮官並不愚蠢，他會想辦法確保自己的計畫能成功。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，假設戰士之中真的有叛徒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一定是最有可能被我們救出來的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "排查範圍小了很多。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "最有嫌疑的人顯而易見。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想輕易指控任何一位為了家園而抛灑熱血的戰士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你有什麼計畫嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "請叫上費斯特和洛洛。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們一起去探望一下傷患。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不往前走？指揮官剛剛發來消息，比爾快醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......洛洛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想去找指揮官，跟她說，以後我不再擔任行動隊的隊長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "包裹？裡面是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "強尼和加比的東西。該留給他們家人的，我都揀出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的都是一些工具和武器裝備，你真的......放不下他們的話，就選幾樣有用的好好加工，讓他們繼續陪我們一起戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我的副隊長駁回了我的辭職申請......那走吧，我們一起去看看比爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂女士有事離開了，本來是她在這裡負責傷患的救治統籌工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......您是費斯特先生的隊員。您叫比爾，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾先生，需要我去把費斯特先生和洛洛小姐叫過來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭小姐，我選擇在此時醒過來，是為了與你聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對你......嗯，一直很好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們為何這麼信任你？你只是個十幾歲的卡特斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是指......羅德島的幹員們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一起經歷了很多事。您說他們信任我，沒錯，可這份信任是相互的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我看來，自救軍的大家也是這樣相處的。您也信任費斯特先生和洛洛小姐，還有克洛維希婭，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......相互的信任？那也需要一個由來，並且通過一連串艱難的考驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的權力並非來自血統，你的地位也並不由力量保障。與你得到的信任相比，你還是太稚嫩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......比爾先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你心裡也想過這些問題吧？但你不敢表現出來。你的恐懼，你的憂慮，你的焦灼，都被壓抑在了他們強加於你的責任之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是在關心我嗎？難道您聽見了我和海蒂女士的對話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......或許吧。我全都聽見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您的關心，但是，我不認同這責任是別人強加給我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹員們對我有期待，而我也願意回應這份期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然......當然。你始終活在他們熱切的視線中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是阿米婭......他們在看著你的時候，是否是在透過你，尋找另一個滄桑得多的靈魂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你所相信的，到底是你真正相信的，還是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直在做著一個別人給你的夢......怎麼掙扎都醒不過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾先生......不，你不是他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你究竟是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，這個問題該由我們來問你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......阿米婭究竟是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該離開這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到在你手心聚集的能量束了。你不是猜到我是誰了嗎？為什麼不動手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觸摸不到你的情緒，“比爾先生”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......我同樣感受不到你的惡意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明可以繼續裝睡的。可你偏偏對我說了這些話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，剛才說過了呀，我們對你很好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是因為你，我們也不想來這裡。特雷西斯都不能命令我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論你的目的是什麼......這很殘忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殘忍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是指我們用的這張臉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我必須請你離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色線條再次從她掌心湧出，在身穿自救軍制服的男人身邊結了一張網。\n其中一道凝成無光的鋒刃，抵住了他的咽喉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還真是......溫柔的威脅啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，很多人都說過了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的挺像她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請別再說這些話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，你還是太稚嫩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在動手之前，你應該先看一眼身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿米婭小姐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你你你......你要殺老比爾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你讓我帶人來這裡，不僅僅是想讓我看到這一幕吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也想看看動手的人是誰。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你已經見到了“叛徒”。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你指的肯定不是阿米婭。那麼，是比爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛......洛洛，救救我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我寧願自己死去......也不會傷害你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別靠近他。我......不，沒人瞭解他源石技藝的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說的話......以及他本身，都很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭小姐......我能相信你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨夜你和我們一起並肩作戰。我以為羅德島真的就像你們說的那樣，是我們的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的表情讓我害怕。我總覺得我在哪裡見過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你在為你即將造成的傷痛而難過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，你......你們為什麼還要動手？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......薩卡茲在我面前奪走了我的父親，你還要再一次把家人從我身邊帶走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，洛洛小姐......你的家人，他已經離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是比爾明明就在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要接受這件事......對你們來說一定很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，阿米婭，我們不是不願意相信你，但我們沒有你的源石技藝，看不見你能看見的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指揮官......我能看見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他可能真的不是我們的老比爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是他身上這些傷......都是昨天為了救我留下來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，是你說的，薩卡茲很會偽裝，我們不能被表象蒙蔽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，我把準備送給老比爾的磐蟹帶來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，這東西什麼時候爬到我身上來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他一眼都沒有看。他眼裡只有阿米婭小姐，他在為成功欺騙了我們而得意，他早就忘記了......他眼裡並沒有我們的約定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為這不起眼的小機械？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特，你不覺得你的判斷太草率了嗎？我們可是最好的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩天我是做了挺多草率的決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾......老比爾，他要是還在的話，一定會狠狠地笑話我。我很想他，我真的很想他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你是誰......別逼我用扳手把你臉上的面具搗下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，你也和他一樣，要傷我的心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我永遠相信我的家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你......你越來越不像他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾他不會像你這樣說話，他從來不會逼迫我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們真覺得我不是他？費斯特，你真能接受這結果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道，這樣的話，你那兩個朋友可是白死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰都有資格這麼說，但你他媽的沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......你挺聰明的，可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炮手，準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，將軍，防禦炮炮口瞄準了目標地塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住，除了車站和鐵軌以外，所有建築都是我們的打擊目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把輸出功率提到最高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最、最高？那可能會炸穿結構層——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽到赦罪師信使說的話了嗎？在他們眼裡，這地塊連帶著上面的廠房，對我們來說都沒用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......那我們在下面的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷會守在城牆下的安全區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
