      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通知海蒂女士和哈默，我們立刻撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，檢測到強烈源石反應！他們正在瞄準我們所在的位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十秒，還有十秒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九秒——"
